Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.32,Cap,,0,0,0,,what the f***?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.32,0:00:01.68,Cap,,0,0,0,,the jets
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.68,0:00:02.44,Cap,,0,0,0,,got into kansas
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.44,0:00:03.76,Cap,,0,0,0,,city territory five
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.76,0:00:04.48,Cap,,0,0,0,,times in
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.48,0:00:05.60,Cap,,0,0,0,,one half and
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.60,0:00:07.68,Cap,,0,0,0,,scored zero touchdowns.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.68,0:00:08.02,Cap,,0,0,0,,so could the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.02,0:00:08.70,Cap,,0,0,0,,jets even beat
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.70,0:00:10.84,Cap,,0,0,0,,11 paper airplanes?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.84,0:00:12.22,Cap,,0,0,0,,sunday in kansas city,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.22,0:00:14.56,Cap,,0,0,0,,chiefs 35, jets 12.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.56,0:00:15.74,Cap,,0,0,0,,every jets point came
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.74,0:00:17.50,Cap,,0,0,0,,off the kicker's foot.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.50,0:00:18.18,Cap,,0,0,0,,paper airplanes have
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.18,0:00:19.28,Cap,,0,0,0,,no arms, no
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.28,0:00:21.12,Cap,,0,0,0,,legs, and no playbook.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.12,0:00:22.00,Cap,,0,0,0,,except they can
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.00,0:00:22.72,Cap,,0,0,0,,do one thing
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.72,0:00:24.04,Cap,,0,0,0,,the jets can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.04,0:00:24.32,Cap,,0,0,0,,land in
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.32,0:00:25.40,Cap,,0,0,0,,the end zone.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.40,0:00:26.24,Cap,,0,0,0,,kick off on a
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.24,0:00:27.88,Cap,,0,0,0,,rooftop in new york.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.88,0:00:29.60,Cap,,0,0,0,,geno smith drops back.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.60,0:00:30.02,Cap,,0,0,0,,sacked by
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.02,0:00:31.54,Cap,,0,0,0,,a paper airplane.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.54,0:00:32.40,Cap,,0,0,0,,next drive, the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.40,0:00:33.98,Cap,,0,0,0,,jets reach the five.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.98,0:00:34.66,Cap,,0,0,0,,field goal.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.66,0:00:35.66,Cap,,0,0,0,,then the eight.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.66,0:00:36.34,Cap,,0,0,0,,field goal.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.34,0:00:37.20,Cap,,0,0,0,,a paper airplane
