Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.02,0:00:39.90,Cap,,0,0,0,,touchdown.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.90,0:00:40.78,Cap,,0,0,0,,in the booth.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.78,0:00:41.42,Cap,,0,0,0,,the jets are moving
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.42,0:00:42.96,Cap,,0,0,0,,the ball really well.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.96,0:00:44.54,Cap,,0,0,0,,they're losing to paper.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.54,0:00:44.74,Cap,,0,0,0,,up in
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.74,0:00:45.76,Cap,,0,0,0,,the stands, kenneth
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.76,0:00:46.30,Cap,,0,0,0,,walker and
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.30,0:00:47.28,Cap,,0,0,0,,travis kelce are
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.28,0:00:48.86,Cap,,0,0,0,,folding more airplanes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.86,0:00:50.14,Cap,,0,0,0,,just in case.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.14,0:00:50.98,Cap,,0,0,0,,fourth quarter.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.98,0:00:51.70,Cap,,0,0,0,,jets down two.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.70,0:00:52.68,Cap,,0,0,0,,fourth and goal
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.68,0:00:53.64,Cap,,0,0,0,,from the one.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.64,0:00:54.48,Cap,,0,0,0,,they finally go
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.48,0:00:55.24,Cap,,0,0,0,,for it and
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.24,0:00:56.30,Cap,,0,0,0,,get stuffed by a
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.30,0:00:57.42,Cap,,0,0,0,,paper airplane lying
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.42,0:00:58.84,Cap,,0,0,0,,on the goal line.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.84,0:00:59.90,Cap,,0,0,0,,final score, paper
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.90,0:01:02.34,Cap,,0,0,0,,airplanes 14, jets 12.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.34,0:01:03.58,Cap,,0,0,0,,the exact score kansas
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.58,0:01:05.08,Cap,,0,0,0,,city had at halftime.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.08,0:01:06.30,Cap,,0,0,0,,then the jets fold
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.30,0:01:07.88,Cap,,0,0,0,,into paper airplanes too.
