Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.58,0:01:09.54,Cap,,0,0,0,,and land on
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.54,0:01:11.00,Cap,,0,0,0,,the one yard line.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.00,0:01:11.82,Cap,,0,0,0,,field goal.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.82,0:01:12.64,Cap,,0,0,0,,after the game,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.64,0:01:13.36,Cap,,0,0,0,,the chiefs signed
